## Reference: Engine command comparison

| Operation | dbt Core | dbt Fusion |
|-----------|----------|------------|
| Run models | `dbt run` | `dbtf run` |
| Run tests | `dbt test` | `dbtf test` |
| Compile | `dbt compile` | `dbtf compile` |
| Run macro | `dbt run-operation` | `dbtf run-operation` |
| Install packages | `dbt deps` | `dbtf deps` |

Always pass `--project-dir` and `--profiles-dir` explicitly.
